blished proof source, not an existing published counterexample. Catalog 10000037 / AMR-099-0037 is one result family; source/dependency DOIs are references only.</p><p>The proposed deposit consists of the five-page PDF and a complete editable source and exact-verification ZIP. A new standard-library checker tests 2048 finite corner-containing dual-boundary sets, all 64 bond configurations of a small series replacement with 192 connectivity comparisons and its joint law, a 4392-vertex metric patch with 2116 sampled pairs, 200 explicit weak paths, exact rational constants/tails, and nine false controls. These finite diagnostics supplement the written infinite proof and do not certify universal quantifiers or priority. AI tools were extensively used in planning, mathematical exploration, proof development and reconstruction, computation, literature investigation, writing, editing and adversarial verification. Alec Kriebel is the named human author. The preprint is unrefereed, without conventional independent human peer review, journal acceptance or formal proof-assistant certification; internal AI audits do not provide these certifications. Authored prose is CC BY 4.0 and authored code is MIT licensed.</p>",
